      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `moderate_batch.py` that moderates a batch of user messages and returns per-message decisions using a concrete external provider, I will choose the Perspective API by Jigsaw, which is a service designed to detect toxic content in text. The integration will be identifiable by importing the `perspectiveapi` module and using the `AnalyzeComment` request with the Perspective API endpoint. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
