        "text": "<thinking> To implement the file `moderate_text.py` that scores user text for unsafe or policy-violating content, I need to integrate with a concrete external provider. I will use the Amazon Comprehend service, which provides natural language processing to extract insights and relationships from text. This service is identifiable by the `boto3` library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, and the specific service name `comprehend`. </thinking>\n",
